==Description==
The '''Default Charm''' is a [[charms|charm]] given to everyone upon joining the game.

==Appearance==
The '''Default Charm''' is a humanoid that uses the Roblox R15 body rig on a stand. It plays a short impact sound when placed down.

The color of the charm is based on the player's name color in chat. By default, it is blue, though this is only visible in the inventory.

